#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:4 feb034928e494f7f96da16e946bf488b
msgid "用户实例"
msgstr "user instance"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:6 699adff69b05437fbf33c03b1518c963
msgid "在“实例”中，用户点击实例名称，可以查看实例的基本信息、资源详情、服务和集群， 并对实例进行操作。"
msgstr ""
"In Instances, the user clicks on the instance name to view basic information"
" about the instance, resource details, services, and clusters, and to "
"manipulate the instance."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:11 5da5bcfc06fc47cc88f894dd10e44e4f
msgid ""
"此处显示的实例包含\\ :ref:`独占实例 <apply private instance>`\\ 和\\ :ref:`独占集群 <apply "
"private cluster>`。"
msgstr ""
"The instances shown here include\\ :ref:`Private Instance <apply private "
"instance>`\\ and\\ :ref:`Private Cluster <apply private cluster>`."

