#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:21 e032744e93a4499db23316dee76dbeb4
msgid "基本信息显示当前实例的运行状态、运行剩余时间、健康状态、资源分配状态、创建实例所用的应用、创建时间。"
msgstr ""
"The basic information shows the running status of the current instance, the "
"remaining time to run, the health status, the resource allocation status, "
"the application used to create the instance, and the creation time."

