msgstr "instance resource information"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:33 5a6fe988f75d4417982d2bc99293f423
msgid "服务"
msgstr "Service"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:35 dbe1b61fcab943f08682d7d4c5d5340a
msgid ""
"服务显示该实例当前的健康状态和开通的功能，例如控制台、交互界面和SSH等。可以点击图标选择相应的服务，也可以\\ :ref:`添加自定义服务 "
"<customize service>`。"
msgstr ""
"The service displays the current health status and enabled features of the "
"instance, such as the console, interface, and SSH. You can click the icon to"
" select the appropriate service, or you can\\ :ref:`add a custom service "
"<customize service>`."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:37 6a5dcda0391b40f1a7e8c2a5d05bba98
msgid "|instance service information|"
msgstr "|instance service information|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:254 65c3cc33e8c24cfdb1bf0b5804523475
