msgstr "instance node information"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:46 7e1f4d08485141019a968051a9662ac4
msgid ""
"根据用户创建的类型不同，节点数量也不同，有的为单节点\\ :ref:`独占实例 <apply private instance>`\\ ，有的为\\ "
":ref:`独占集群 <apply private cluster>`。"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the type of user creation, the number of nodes is also "
"different. Some are single-node\\ :ref:`private instances <apply private "
"instance>`\\, and some are\\ :ref:`private clusters <apply private "
"cluster>`."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:48 964a84d2737a4cfd91a2c67e7cfc11f5
msgid "|instance single node|"
msgstr "|instance single node|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:256 91767d5ae74548cf9f153d5af074264e
#: dc50e902c3fb4ecdae901c777065d2a4
msgid "instance single node"
msgstr "instance single node"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:50 e2af38c33ccf4baaaebb19a5d959038a
msgid "|instance multiple nodes|"
msgstr "|instance multiple nodes|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:257 0b559c1363704a7f90dd1c773353f15d
#: bda0cd6024d349a3a8e80b673d54f277
msgid "instance multiple nodes"
msgstr "instance multiple nodes"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:52 d748b13237d0441e86cac0cdda6d319d
msgid "可以点击节点图标，切换下方的节点详细信息。"
msgstr "You can toggle the node details below by clicking the node icon."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:54 6c41b5e8dced46e397686ca9b5345b6d
msgid "|change node|"
msgstr "|change node|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:258 329cc6356d80415aa2e9ec736caebbaa
#: d5a80bd8d2ab47d38620ff77972f0a09
msgid "change node"
msgstr "change node"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:56 02032313be3f4234b3223913802a90b8
msgid "节点详细信息包含如下："
msgstr "Node details include the following:"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:58 1b2e655d62d54f0f8ffd386332042a41
msgid "**名称**：节点名称。"
msgstr "**Name**: The name of the node."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:60 90e2cdf240bb4dfd83c08ef61d2ab6fb
msgid "**ID**：节点的ID。"
msgstr "**ID**: ID of the node."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:62 718934c779ac407583dd30f23560b519
msgid ""
"**类型**：分为“CTRT容器”，“OCI容器”和“虚拟机”。“CTRT容器”是专为集群开发的容器，根据集群的需求可以进行更细粒度的控制。“OCI容器”是Docker的标准化容器。"
msgstr ""
"**Type**: Divided into \"CTRT Container\", \"OCI Container\" and \"Virtual "
"Machine\". The \"CTRT Container\" is a container developed specifically for "
"the cluster, allowing for finer-grained control depending on the needs of "
"the cluster. The OCI Container is a standardized container for Docker."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:64 3ec73d2f5d7b44c6a4be6b73348a7187
msgid ""
"**角色**：分为“主节点”、“工作站”和“计算节点”。“主节点”是作业队列系统的管理节点，负责接受用户提交的任务，进行任务调度和分发。“工作站”节点主要用于用户登录、作业提交、作业查看、文本编辑、数据传输等工作。“计算节点”用于处理用户的计算任务。"
msgstr ""
"**Roles**: divided into \"Master Node\", \"Workstation\" and \"Compute "
"Node\". The \"master node\" is the management node of the job queue system, "
"responsible for accepting tasks submitted by users, task scheduling and "
"distribution. The Workstation node is mainly used for user login, job "
"submission, job viewing, text editing, data transmission and other work. The"
" Compute Node is used to handle the user's computational tasks."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:66 faefac31c14a4d14a98284fffd151c1c
msgid "**运行状态**：显示节点当前的运行状态，例如“运行中”、“等待”、“暂停”、“错误”等等。"
msgstr ""
"**Run status**: Displays the current running status of the node, such as "
"\"Running\", \"Waiting\", \"Paused\", \"Error\", etc."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:68 38c5d328d55b4e54bc788088782910dc
msgid "**物理节点**：显示当前节点所在的物理节点。"
msgstr ""
"**Physical Node**: Displays the physical node where the current node is "
"located."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:70 11a28490b02a4b9cad5273f1e0233255
msgid "**资源分配**：当前节点所占用的资源。"
msgstr "**Resource allocation**: The resources occupied by the current node."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:72 a9b712b06e044551882a1d87f60cfa94
msgid "**资源使用统计**：最近6小时的CPU和内存使用情况。"
msgstr ""
"**Resource usage statistics**: CPU and memory usage in the last 6 hours."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:77 8faeb743444246f0a6f11a1fce465376
msgid "启动/停止实例"
msgstr "Start/Stop Instance"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:79 66746855ea5348d9af4b0455a5cd3d26
msgid "实例详情的右上角，有“启动”和“停止”按钮，点击后就可以运行或停止实例。"
msgstr ""
"In the upper right corner of the instance details, there are \"Start\" and "
"\"Stop\" buttons, which can be clicked to run or stop the instance."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:81 3923d733e2954bd89e760dc1a3ebab9c
msgid "|change state|"
msgstr "|change state|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:259 530c6e0117b04753a09280cc79ed3447
#: 9e464a57ee1a4ca8baf943eb4990c0a1
msgid "change state"
msgstr "change state"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:84 86c914220afa42ad928b47bacc816d66
msgid "实例延期"
msgstr "Instance deferral"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:86 0548aa118dfb474699b656e1c121ebd3
msgid ""
"为了充分的利用资源，每个实例都设有默认的最长使用期限。当创建实例成功后就开始倒计时，倒计时为零时，系统会自动停止该实例释放资源。如果用户希望延长实例的使用时间，可以申请对实例延期。"
msgstr ""
"To make the most of your resources, each instance has a default maximum age."
" When the countdown starts after the instance is successfully created, and "
"the countdown is zero, the system automatically stops the instance from "
"releasing resources. If the user wishes to extend the usage time of the "
"instance, an extension of the instance can be requested."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:88 ac79fb3c18d24fccaed1c1b9be97fe48
msgid "点击“实例”中的“申请延期”。"
msgstr "Under Examples, click Request Extension."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:90 91888e3fde6244f29e914b27fe53acba
msgid "|apply delay|"
msgstr "|apply delay|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:260 503da8faba074e3e8c9605b546824312
#: 99e3dc3a917c4da9a56ee79e5f3e5689
msgid "apply delay"
msgstr "apply delay"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:92 b1b0eab310ce4ce59fb8fbfa2d34f93f
msgid "在窗口中选择需要延期的类型，填写希望延长的时间和理由，并提交管理员审批。"
msgstr ""
"In the window, select the type that needs to be extended, fill in the time "
"and reason for the desired extension, and submit it to the administrator for"
" approval."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:94 bdba0b7af9fa45efa3d80e23a2025acf
msgid "|select extend type 1|"
msgstr "|select extend type 1|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:261 8abc3a0446f64ed8a7e144e6db677156
#: f79e575f1d134a7b95a27f6bfc3f6fb8
msgid "select extend type 1"
msgstr "select extend type 1"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:96 85a41dcd0c98450d8bbe23349d462eb5
msgid "|select extend type 2|"
msgstr "|select extend type 2|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:262 4f759b16d5394460a8ec1543c3cac740
#: 7401784110714aa4a415b0a84075ca83
msgid "select extend type 2"
msgstr "select extend type 2"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:98 08e2763825e546b9ad39723f8b6c44ba
msgid "**延后实例本次运行的截止日期**：延期申请只针对当前正在运行的实例，不影响之后的实例运行。"
msgstr ""
"**Extend the deadline for this run of the instance**: The extension request "
"is only for the currently running instance and does not affect the running "
"of subsequent instances."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:99 6c32719e03094a32ae4fa366d68e9218
msgid "**更新实例的使用期限**：申请用户该实例的默认最长使用期限，只对下次及以后的运行有效。"
msgstr ""
"**Update the lifetime of an instance**: Request the user's default maximum "
"lifetime for the instance, valid only for the next and subsequent runs."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:103 7e02c2c0aa5f446f9171ada527c787e1
msgid "如果要对当前正在运行的实例进行延期，请预留审批时间，避免在快截止时提出申请。"
msgstr ""
"If you are extending an instance that is currently running, set aside "
"approval time to avoid submitting a request near the deadline."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:105 133b2ce857924605af03b2182fb63520
msgid "用户可以在“申请”中查看自己已经提交的延期请求以及审批情况。"
msgstr ""
"Users can view their submitted extension requests and approvals in Requests."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:107 a4c24eb27fb4458c949ad9921e79543e
msgid "|approval state|"
msgstr "|approval state|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:263 662a3f1e706f4272ab16ad2cc38b4375
#: 6e53be099c3e4125b8b379d57292d619
msgid "approval state"
msgstr "approval state"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:111 d1e6f69d9da94adcb1764e5181d9f312
msgid "如果实例有还未审批的请求，不允许对该实例提交相同类型的延期请求。需要等审批完毕后才能再次提交。"
msgstr ""
"If an instance has an unapproved request, it is not allowed to submit an "
"extension request of the same type for that instance. You will need to wait "
"for approval before submitting again."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:116 00ee3455c99447f48f6452e9cc7c8109
msgid "资源释放"
msgstr "Resource Release"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:119 af8bcdd3a1734d7183056e43923d746c
msgid "实例会从创建开始计费，直到自动或手动释放资源停止计费。因此如果资源使用完毕，记得及时手动释放资源。"
msgstr ""
"Instances are billed from creation until resources are automatically or "
"manually released to stop billing. Therefore, if the resources are used up, "
"remember to release the resources manually in time."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:121 ce1ed2e8d15d4f55831cf377e6bde3b6
msgid "实例只有在停止状态下才能释放资源。:ref:`停止实例 <change state>`\\ 后，点击“释放资源”按钮，并停止计费。"
msgstr ""
"Resources can be released only while the instance is stopped. After "
":ref:`stopping the instance <change state>`\\, click \"Release Resources\" "
"to stop billing."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:123 fe4da92b58fa450bb81e101996155f40
msgid "|release|"
msgstr "|release|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:265 6ab0b25d381f4e50bfdfe8440db4053f
#: ab14e056dfe940b8b01a67c7d80c2ca9
msgid "release"
msgstr "release"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:125 7d926ff3227a4498be75c0010250bbdb
msgid "已经释放资源的实例会进入“回收站”，用户可以在“回收站”里找到实例，并重新分配资源，进入计费状态。"
msgstr ""
"Instances that have released resources will enter the Recycle Bin. Users can"
" find the instances in the Recycle Bin and reallocate the resources to enter"
" the billing state."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:127 f561179860db468b82b32563e07cea06
msgid "|allocate|"
msgstr "|allocate|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:264 a934eee20b3c41538fbc2eb1b9980227
#: cc1aa1603ce2480ba61804bef0af47f9
msgid "allocate"
msgstr "allocate"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:131 6c6caf78f25a42659467d6ecf8eb8fac
msgid "进入“回收站”的实例的数据和环境都依然保存。如果希望彻底删除，点击删除图标，将实例和数据彻底删除。"
msgstr ""
"The data and environment entering the instances of the Recycle Bin are still"
" saved. If you want to delete it completely, click the delete icon to delete"
" the instance and data completely."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:136 13a64cd59bb846e3ab1df93e004f6f4d
msgid "磁盘扩容"
msgstr "Disk expansion"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:138 3a35e94f2acd45caa4efb725d571a47c
msgid ""
"实例只有在停止状态下才能磁盘扩容。:ref:`停止实例 <change state>`\\ "
"后，在列表中点击磁盘扩容按钮，或是在实例详情中点击磁盘扩容按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Disk expansion is available only while the instance is stopped. After "
":ref:`stopping the instance <change state>`\\, click the disk expansion "
"button in the list or in the instance details."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:140 bebfbeeceaf145ac96e44d404503cb5c
msgid "|expand disk|"
msgstr "|expand disk|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:142 3a69109fb2aa449e90a7a41c496e97d5
#: 45003f9a6aae43a58198e674e98d6332
msgid "expand disk"
msgstr "expand disk"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:144 6ab17eb9df1b49f1acff3a3e07bda287
msgid "|expand disk2|"
msgstr "|expand disk2|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:146 43f0298f2d8e4e18ab8fd4f281d13963
#: 85d7b00317ac4e818c09c8b138c9ea61
msgid "expand disk2"
msgstr "expand disk2"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:148 6286a9ff6e0c4d1c929e21d6d2fa37b3
msgid "在弹出窗口中，通过滑条或是直接输入磁盘尺寸调整所需要的磁盘大小后，点击确定完成扩容。"
msgstr ""
"In the pop-up window, click OK to complete the expansion after adjusting the"
" required disk size through the slider or directly entering the disk size."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:150 17395170f329407a918c372dc112dbc7
msgid "|set disk volume|"
msgstr "|set disk volume|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:152 11a5244e8141480bbbb5319a8a249ec3
#: 3fb7d559d9544330b1e023e2f36a13fb
msgid "set disk volume"
msgstr "set disk volume"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:156 895f7a2b79304db684d14525d6ea4ffa
msgid "扩容大小在2048G范围内，实例自动扩容，无需其他额外操作，直接使用扩容空间。"
msgstr ""
"The expansion size is in the range of 2048G, and the instance is "
"automatically expanded without additional operations, directly using the "
"expansion space."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:158 569aaada8d0a47b3a6e33273cc6fe563
msgid "扩容大小在2048G以上，需要按照以下教程操作。"
msgstr ""
"The expansion size is above 2048G, you need to follow the following "
"tutorials."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:160 3418e32bc3784300919e26775acb951a
msgid "扩容完成后，启动实例，进入到实例中。"
msgstr ""
"After the expansion is completed, start the instance and enter the instance."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:162 5d03e6b6b5e047f5869f33b4464b68a5
msgid "在命令行输入\\ ``lsblk``\\ ，查看磁盘扩容情况，本次扩容空间大小为20T，见下图："
msgstr ""
"Enter\\ `` lsblk ``\\ on the command line to check the disk expansion. The "
"size of the expansion space is 20t, as shown in the following figure:"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:164 6b213cfd212e43a9933d0c2d5de8a95d
msgid "|check disk volume|"
msgstr "|check disk volume|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:166 54064dd75b24415f83d641132d884726
#: aa23543bbfdf492683e73c1b9b704d5d
msgid "check disk volume"
msgstr "check disk volume"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:168 1dd788a170244872a63a40771cad74be
msgid "在命令行继续输入\\ ``df -Th``\\ 查看磁盘的格式，主要包含ext4或者xfs两种，本次实例查看见下图："
msgstr ""
"Continue typing\\ `` df -Th ``\\ on the command line to see the format of "
"the disk, which mainly contains ext4 or xfs. See the following figure for "
"this example:"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:170 963657c163b34b25b11053fe467a0ee8
msgid "|check disk format|"
msgstr "|check disk format|"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:172 2d47ee30d9a44268a62835cf60e39424
#: 410e94d2227549e48d74f2149a5847b1
msgid "check disk format"
msgstr "check disk format"

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:174 735298ae193d4f2caed50e528610a149
msgid ""
"可以看到，``lsblk``\\ 和\\ ``df -Th``\\ 两个命令看到的磁盘大小是不一样的。用\\ ``lsblk``\\ "
"看到的是20T，但是用\\ ``df -Th``\\ 查看只有49G，两者存在差异。这是因为\\ ``lsblk``\\ 查看的是block "
"device，即逻辑磁盘大小。\\ ``df``\\ 查看的是file system, 即文件系统层的磁盘大小。磁盘扩容后，block "
"device容量变大，但还没有反映到file system中，需要用resize2fs 命令来更新。"
msgstr ""
"As you can see, the two commands` 'lsblk` `\\ and` `df -Th' '\\ see "
"different disk sizes. What you see with\\` `lsblk` `\\ is 20t, but what you "
"see with\\` `df -Th` `\\ is only 49g, there is a difference between the two."
" This is because\\` `lsblk` `\\ is looking at the block device, which is the"
" logical disk size.\\` `df` `\\ is looking at the file system, which is the "
"disk size of the file system layer. After disk expansion, the capacity of "
"the block device becomes larger, but it has not been reflected in the file "
"system, and it needs to be updated with the resize2fs command."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:176 0990e3ed2438465a8a4f415ec53376a1
msgid ""
"在命令行输入\\ ``resize2fs /dev/vda1``\\ "
"进行更新，扩容时间视扩容空间大小而定，扩容20T需要几分钟的时间，提示如下图所示内容，表示扩容完成。"
msgstr ""
"Enter\\ `` resize2fs/dev/vda1 ``\\ on the command line to update. The "
"expansion time depends on the size of the expansion space. It takes a few "
"minutes to expand 20t. The following figure shows the content of the prompt,"
" indicating that the expansion is complete."

#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:178 ae5228a5213c409db0cc4558bbb9c8f6
msgid "|resize disk|"
msgstr "|resize disk|"

