#: ../../docs/mode/instance.rst:182 29241fad08be46048e07c20f271e64a5
msgid "在命令行输入\\ ``df -Th``\\ 查看扩容后的磁盘空间，可以看到已经变为20T。"
msgstr ""
"Enter\\ `` df -Th ``\\ on the command line to view the expanded disk space "
"and you can see that it has changed to 20t."

